Increases your movement speed by [0.06%, 0.17%, 0.25%, 0.32%, 0.38% (TL1-5)] per percent of positive energy and your casting speed by [0.06%, 0.17%, 0.25%, 0.32%, 0.38% (TL1-5)] per percent of negative energy, up to a maximum of [5.00%, 13%, 20%, 25%, 30% (TL1-5)] at 80%. Sustained energy still counts toward the maximum.
